## Final checklist

Before you stop, confirm:
- [ ] Every chart/table `data_ref` was produced via `save_query`.
- [ ] Vega-Lite encoding `type`s match the saved column types.
- [ ] `layout` sections satisfy `children.length == columns.length`.
- [ ] No section id is reused.
- [ ] `save_manifest` returned `success: 1`.
